  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'Everyone antes to a pot. Dealer deals three cards face down to each player in a stack, then turns the next card for trump. If the turn-up is an Ace, the dealer wins the pot immediately. Otherwise the dealer may sell the trump to the highest bidder. In turn from the left of the dealer (or purchaser), each player turns up the top card of their stack; the holder of the current highest trump is exempt and keeps cards concealed. When a higher trump is revealed, that player may sell it. Anyone may also buy face-down cards from another (mystery purchase). When all cards are revealed, the holder of the highest trump wins the pot.',
    Player: 'Everyone antes to a pot. Dealer deals three cards face down to each player in a stack, then turns the next card for trump. If the turn-up is an Ace, the dealer wins the pot immediately. Otherwise the dealer may sell the trump to the highest bidder. In turn from the left of the dealer (or purchaser), each player turns up the top card of their stack; the holder of the current highest trump is exempt and keeps cards concealed. When a higher trump is revealed, that player may sell it. Anyone may also buy face-down cards from another (mystery purchase). When all cards are revealed, the holder of the highest trump wins the pot.',
    objective: 'Hold the highest trump card revealed at the end of the hand.',
    gameplay: 'Everyone antes to a pot. Dealer deals three cards face down to each player in a stack, then turns the next card for trump. If the turn-up is an Ace, the dealer wins the pot immediately. Otherwise the dealer may sell the trump to the highest bidder. In turn from the left of the dealer (or purchaser), each player turns up the top card of their stack; the holder of the current highest trump is exempt and keeps cards concealed. When a higher trump is revealed, that player may sell it. Anyone may also buy face-down cards from another (mystery purchase). When all cards are revealed, the holder of the highest trump wins the pot.',
    keyRules: [
      'Trump is the only suit that counts; highest trump wins the pot.',
      'Dealer turns one card for trump; if Ace, dealer wins immediately.',
      'Dealer may sell the turn-up; players may buy or sell the current highest trump or buy mystery face-down cards.',
      'Players reveal top card of their stack in rotation; holder of current high trump is exempt from revealing.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
